    "title": "Glide Popper 18cm - 75g",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">18 cm and 75g of weight. It is a small mouth popper that you can retrieve quickly with repeated splashes but if necessary make a nice sound if moved with traditional action on the spot. I designed this popper thinking about rooster or big leerfish or gt that in places with a lot of pressure react badly to the deep bursts of some poppers. obviously it has a weight and a measure that is perfect for tuna. enjoy!</p>",
